
### GET all movies - Local
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### POST new movie - Local
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "director": "Lana Wachowski and Lilly Wachowski",
  "year": 1999,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "rating": 9,
  "language": "English",
  "duration": 136
}

